                  <h3 className="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 font-serif">Application Submitted</h3>
                  <p className="text-gray-600 mb-8 max-w-sm mx-auto">
                    Thank you for applying for <strong>{selectedTier}</strong> membership. Our secretariat will review your details and contact you for the next steps.
